Attribution / происхождение

Product / продукт: overflow.name — TTML Karaoke Generator

This project is an independent remake and modernization of the original
browser-based TTML lyrics generator published by НЦА (NCA) around 2022
(Apple Music Time Synced Lyrics / karaoke-style workflow).

Этот проект — самостоятельная переделка и модернизация оригинального
браузерного генератора TTML-текстов песен, выпущенного НЦА около 2022 года.

The original product, branding, and any associated trademarks remain the
property of their respective owners. This remake reimplements the workflow
(upload audio + lyrics → mark lines with Space → export TTML) on a modern
open stack. It is not an official NCA release.
